{"id":"sysc-greet-dev-13","content_hash":"b3cd75176211d95cd0b023d82aa6a92e06546c640dea000151b82d6d6a7c1f95","title":"Fix Cagebreak multi-output layer-shell positioning upstream","description":"","design":"Coordinate an upstream Cagebreak issue and tested PR for per-output layer-shell scene positioning.","notes":"Cagebreak issue #97 and PR #98 are open. PR updated with in-tree multi-output layer-shell regression test commit dc3d11b. The test fails against parent bc5b2ce and passes on the fix; all 3 basic tests pass, 10 consecutive direct runs pass, and all 4 affected devel checks pass. Full devel suite is 8/10 because two clean-build checks hit the pre-existing wlroots 0.20.1 metadata versus installed 0.20.2 mismatch. Awaiting upstream review and real greeter testing.","status":"in_progress","priority":1,"issue_type":"bug","created_at":"2026-08-04T09:12:11.648552596+10:00","updated_at":"2026-08-04T10:19:08.55688945+10:00","external_ref":"https://github.com/project-repo/cagebreak/issues/97"}
